step Irontree Woods
  tip Follow the road north-east to Irontree Woods. The Warpwood Moss Flayers and Shredders on the east side of the woods each carry a Blood Amber; Angerclaw Grizzlies and Felpaw Ravagers roam the same woods for Talo, and their organs are Kelek's.
  tip Felpaw Village's Deadwood Den Watchers (53-54) and Avengers (54-55) are next: below level 54, keep hunting the grizzlies and ravagers (51-52) here until 54. The hand-ins at Timbermaw Hold, the Emerald Sanctuary and Bloodvenom Post that follow take you most of the way to 55. Or, with a group, run the Sunken Temple dungeon or the Blackrock Depths dungeon instead.
